    <section class="page-section page-section--tint"><div class="amz-wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">Leadership</span><h2 class="section-title-new">A Message From Our Leadership</h2><p class="section-copy">A shared commitment to thoughtful healthcare and a better patient experience.</p></div></div><article class="leader-message"><div class="leader-message__photo"><img src="assets/images/pages/chairman.png" alt="Chairman of AMZ Hospital" /></div><div class="leader-message__copy"><span class="section-kicker">CHAIRMAN</span><h2>“We believe every patient deserves to feel seen, heard and supported.”</h2><p>At AMZ Hospital, our ambition is to build a care experience that combines clinical quality with real human connection. We are proud of the people who bring this purpose to life every day.</p><strong>Chairman, AMZ Hospital Ltd.</strong></div></article><article class="leader-message is-reverse"><div class="leader-message__copy"><span class="section-kicker">CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER</span><h2>“Excellence means making every next step feel clearer.”</h2><p>Our teams are focused on thoughtful systems, collaboration and a culture of continuous improvement. The goal is simple: make it easier for each person to access care with confidence.</p><strong>Chief Executive Officer, AMZ Hospital Ltd.</strong></div><div class="leader-message__photo"><img src="assets/images/pages/ceo.png" alt="Chief Executive Officer of AMZ Hospital" /></div></article><article class="leader-message"><div class="leader-message__photo"><img src="assets/images/pages/managing-director.png" alt="Managing Director of AMZ Hospital" /></div><div class="leader-message__copy"><span class="section-kicker">MANAGING DIRECTOR</span><h2>“Care is strongest when people and expertise work together.”</h2><p>We are building an environment where professionals can do their best work and patients can receive care that is respectful, coordinated and genuinely personal.</p><strong>Managing Director, AMZ Hospital Ltd.</strong></div></article></div></section>
